      "slug": "moc-nhi",
      "term": "Mộc nhĩ",
      "definition": "Wood ear mushrooms, also called cloud ear or black fungus. They have almost no flavour but add a distinctive crunchy, slippery texture to Vietnamese soups and stir-fries."
    }
